src/unesco_boundary/retrieve.py adapts the retrieval approach and WHC/OSM
queries from cloudcollection/unesco-whc-osm-boundary-retriever.
src/unesco_boundary/maps.py adapts official-map link discovery from
cloudcollection/UNESCO_Map_SC. These two files remain Apache-2.0;
see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. Both have been substantially rewritten.
Exact source revisions and file hashes are in docs/source-manifest.json.

The workflow also consolidates the same owner's unesco-boundary-packager
skill and packaging approach. No LICENSE file was present in that source
revision. Its material has been rewritten for this integration, released
by the repository owner under the MIT License.

External reference projects were consulted for structure and writing;
their implementations were not vendored. See docs/design-references.md.

Code licenses do not grant rights to UNESCO maps, official geodata, or
OpenStreetMap data. Preserve publisher terms and OSM attribution/ODbL
